Define OLEXTPSyntaxEditBorderStyle for Integer
    Define OLExtpBorderNone for 0
    Define OLExtpBorderFlat for 1
    Define OLExtpBorderStaticEdge for 2
    Define OLExtpBorderClientEdge for 3
    Define OLExtpBorderFrame for 4

Define OLESyntaxEditTextAction for Integer
    Define OLEeditAction_InsertRow for 1
    Define OLEeditAction_ModifyRow for 4
    Define OLEeditAction_InsertRow_New for 16

// Dispatch interface for Syntax Edit
Class cSigCjCom_DSyntaxEdit is a Mixin

